$\delta_{\rm rel}$, $\delta_{\gamma p}$, $\delta_{\rm had}$ and $\delta_{1}$ to $\delta_{4}$ are the correlated sources of uncertainties arising from the combination procedure.
The uncertainties are quoted in percent relative to $\sigma_{r,\rm NC}^{+}$.

